contentEn: >-
  To mark the LfA’s 75th anniversary, a website was created to complement the
  grand celebration. This website is the digital version of the anniversary
  magazine and offers even more insights into that special day. The website was
  built using the “Novamag” CMS, with a focus on clarity and ease of navigation.
